<div class="">
  <h3>Input Gallery</h3>


  <div class="p-5">
    <.bnw_button_new />
  </div>


  <hr/>
  <br/>

  This page shows off the input types available and how to use them. 
  Click on the Add new button to see the modal.
  Any HTML input can be given each has its own set of attributes.
  The core attributes are:
  <ul class="ml-5">
    <li>type: The type of input. Required</li>
    <li>name: The name of the input. Required</li>
    <li>min: The minimum value of the input</li>
    <li>max: The maximum value of the input</li>
    <li>step: The step value of the input</li>
  </ul>
  Any input can be given as either .bnw_input or .bnw_input_naked to remove the outer label


  <br/>
  <br/>

